    <notepad>
      <note>- failed_rows_count = trip pending master (start/end_station_id present but no nds.station row - empty start/end_station_sk).
- Not an ETL hard failure, rows stay on staging for the next ETL Staging → NDS run.
- total_rows_count = candidate_rows_count.
- success_rows_count = candidate_rows_count - failed_rows_count</note>
